      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sounds similar to what Lexz is saying about being able to blend the current 2 immobile modes, as in: being able to have separate values for world immobile/joystick movement and ik movement.\nHere's a link if you want to add on here as well: https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-dynamics-reports-and-feedback/p/1194-feedback-immobile-mode-world-blend-multiplier",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
