  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-05-28T15:26:13.681Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The SDK was updated and provided us with two options for PB movement (Immobile and World)\nThis definitely helped keep manual movement from making things explode. But, I think some fine tuning is needed. Hear me out and tell me if this makes sense and/or if it's possible.\nKeep the two options.. or even make a third, but make them independent from each other.\n- World (reduces movement from animation)\n- Immobile (possibly rename? - reduces all movement)\n- Movement (reduces controller based movement only) sorry, couldn't think of a name\n\"World\" and \"Movement\" could be used in conjunction so you have a different settings per type of movement at the same time\nIf Immobile is selected, both World and Movement get disabled, since Immobile covers all aspects of movement",
